# Live bench run state — rewritten continuously while a run is in flight, ~2MB each.
# Immutable snapshots (run_state.final-*.json, epoch-final.log) are kept beside them on
# disk and can be committed deliberately when a run is worth preserving.
tests/bench/writings/real_*/run_state.json
